          "tooltip": "Move by the roll's OWN travel (the Roll state extracts its clip's root travel) instead of the rollSpeed curve above: the body covers exactly the ground the dive does, through its own collision, for as long as the state lasts. The roll always faces the way it goes -- there is only a forward roll."
